<title>USA: Tower Automotive completes Italian purchase.</title>
<headline>Tower Automotive completes Italian purchase.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tower Automotive Inc said Friday it has completed the previously announced acquisition of Societa Industria Meccanica e Stampaggio SpA.</p>
<p>The purchase price for the Turin, Italy-based automotive parts manufacturer was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Societa Industria has annual revenues of about $70 million and its primary customer is Fiat SpA, Tower said.</p>
<p>The purchase was financed using borrowings under Tower Automotive's revolving credit facility. Tower shares rose 7/8 to 41 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
